      "cooked": "<p>Hi All,</p>\n<p>I have a use case where I’m not able to Understand if the behaviour is a BUG or just different approach. For better understanding the details are here:</p>\n<p>Method : Double Declining (DDB)<br>\nI have an <strong>Existing Asset</strong> with Gross <strong>48,00,000/-</strong><br>\nAvailable to User : 01-May-2025<br>\nPurchase Date : 01-May-2025</p>\n<p>The Asset Category has 48 Depreciation Nos configured.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/8/086660783ba3f18f65c79b95a9bfbbf43ef702ec.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/086660783ba3f18f65c79b95a9bfbbf43ef702ec\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/8/086660783ba3f18f65c79b95a9bfbbf43ef702ec_2_690x311.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"1cj9Zlrv1kHKk5vdGcpelZ64jUM\" width=\"690\" height=\"311\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/8/086660783ba3f18f65c79b95a9bfbbf43ef702ec_2_690x311.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/8/086660783ba3f18f65c79b95a9bfbbf43ef702ec.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/8/086660783ba3f18f65c79b95a9bfbbf43ef702ec.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F8F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">772×349 22.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>In Asset,<br>\n<strong>Opening Accumulated Depreciation <strong>and</strong> Opening Number of Booked Depreciations</strong> are taken as <strong>4,00,000</strong> and <strong>2</strong><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/c/6ca4af9bffd6f2ce7db5b90cb6f06d7faaddafb9.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/6ca4af9bffd6f2ce7db5b90cb6f06d7faaddafb9\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/c/6ca4af9bffd6f2ce7db5b90cb6f06d7faaddafb9_2_690x147.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"fv6p6mq9euIjmThUw8YqdpnFMzT\" width=\"690\" height=\"147\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/c/6ca4af9bffd6f2ce7db5b90cb6f06d7faaddafb9_2_690x147.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/c/6ca4af9bffd6f2ce7db5b90cb6f06d7faaddafb9.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/c/6ca4af9bffd6f2ce7db5b90cb6f06d7faaddafb9.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">827×177 7.88 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Expected output is First 10 months with <strong>2,00,000 Depreciation</strong> but system is actually giving below output and also calculating the Depreciation 12 time on current value instead of 10 time as 2 time Depreciation is already done.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/9/392e12344596593c10a3bfbd1d20000910714305.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/392e12344596593c10a3bfbd1d20000910714305\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/9/392e12344596593c10a3bfbd1d20000910714305_2_665x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"89PVcUwBR0XLAHBMXoMUZXrNxit\" width=\"665\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/9/392e12344596593c10a3bfbd1d20000910714305_2_665x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/9/392e12344596593c10a3bfbd1d20000910714305.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/9/392e12344596593c10a3bfbd1d20000910714305.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F1F4\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">829×623 44.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>When using DDB is this correct calculation ? Or the system is having a BUG.</p>\n<p>Tested with <strong>ERPNext:</strong> v15.69.2 (version-15) and <strong>Frappe Framework:</strong> v15.73.0 (version-15)<br>\nAlso<br>\nwith old version<br>\n<strong>ERPNext:</strong> v15.29.3 and <strong>Frappe Framework:</strong> v15.34.1</p>",
