      "created_at": "2025-07-15T09:07:34.231Z",
      "cooked": "<p>it should calculate depreciation based on current book value… the depreciation amount looks wrong</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/d/ada8dbbb3a1885f97178048b24d44f06313d40d0.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/ada8dbbb3a1885f97178048b24d44f06313d40d0\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/d/ada8dbbb3a1885f97178048b24d44f06313d40d0_2_690x271.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"oMgnxuNPxqgYXhLEt2e2niUd7l6\" width=\"690\" height=\"271\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/d/ada8dbbb3a1885f97178048b24d44f06313d40d0_2_690x271.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/d/ada8dbbb3a1885f97178048b24d44f06313d40d0_2_1035x406.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/d/ada8dbbb3a1885f97178048b24d44f06313d40d0_2_1380x542.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2034×800 62.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>it should follow following table</p>\n<div class=\"md-table\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Month</th>\n<th>Start Value</th>\n<th>Depreciation</th>\n<th>End Value</th>\n<th>Method Used</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>200,000.00</td>\n<td>40,000.00</td>\n<td>160,000.00</td>\n<td>DDB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>160,000.00</td>\n<td>32,000.00</td>\n<td>128,000.00</td>\n<td>DDB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>128,000.00</td>\n<td>25,600.00</td>\n<td>102,400.00</td>\n<td>DDB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>102,400.00</td>\n<td>20,480.00</td>\n<td>81,920.00</td>\n<td>DDB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>81,920.00</td>\n<td>16,384.00</td>\n<td>65,536.00</td>\n<td>DDB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>65,536.00</td>\n<td>13,107.20</td>\n<td>52,428.80</td>\n<td>DDB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>52,428.80</td>\n<td>10,485.76</td>\n<td>41,943.04</td>\n<td>DDB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>41,943.04</td>\n<td>8,388.61</td>\n<td>33,554.43</td>\n<td>DDB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>33,554.43</td>\n<td>6,710.89</td>\n<td>26,843.55</td>\n<td>DDB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>26,843.55</td>\n<td>26,843.55</td>\n<td><strong>0.00</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Adjusted</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>",
